📜 User Agreement & Privacy Policy

 By using TeleHeart, you agree to the following terms:

 1. Data Privacy
 - All data processed by the app remains on your device and is never uploaded to external servers.
 - The app reads your Telegram messages only for generating statistics and insights.

 2. Permissions & Usage
 - The app requires access to your Telegram session to analyze your chats.
 - You can choose whether to stay logged in or disconnect upon closing the app.

 3. Advertisements
 - The app displays ads to remain free. You may remove them via an in-app purchase.

 4. No Liability
 - The app is provided as is, and we are not responsible for any loss, misuse, or unintended consequences.

 By tapping "Agree & Continue", you confirm that you understand and accept these terms.
User Agreement Agree & Continue
